# Cloudflare Pages redirects for PlayPad.
# The whole repo root is deployed, so dev-only files would otherwise be served.
# These rules send them to the hub instead. Redirects take precedence over
# static files on Cloudflare Pages.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/docs              /  302
/docs/*            /  302
/package.json      /  302
/package-lock.json /  302
